<title>UK: Newcastle joint CEO Corbridge gives up post.</title>
<headline>Newcastle joint CEO Corbridge gives up post.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Newcastle United Plc announced on Tuesday that joint chief executive Mark Corbridge had relinquished his role with immediate effect.</p>
<p>The company, which owns Newcastle United football club, said the other joint chief executive, Freddie Fletcher, will take over as chief executive of Newcastle United.</p>
